WEBVTT

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:11.646
I share my unstoppable curiosity with you.

00:00:13.765 --> 00:00:17.416
I'm still able to run through the fog...

00:00:17.415 --> 00:00:21.221
...because I know that you're here for me.

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:28.866
I guess the shape of happiness is different for everyone...

00:00:28.869 --> 00:00:33.202
...however, I know it's boring when I'm alone...

00:00:33.584 --> 00:00:35.050
But, with you...

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.168
...it's like a mystery!

00:00:39.016 --> 00:00:42.720
It's an enchanting future, where...

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.440
...in order for me to be strong, it's always you...

00:00:47.442 --> 00:00:51.862
...that I can continue to depend on, right?

00:00:51.862 --> 00:00:53.426
Just to survive!

00:00:53.603 --> 00:00:55.402
Stumped Q? Don't lose your way!

00:00:55.405 --> 00:00:57.232
Take this moment...

00:00:57.232 --> 00:01:00.860
...to fix your gaze and charge on ahead!

00:01:00.865 --> 00:01:03.071
Eternally, we'll always be together...

00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:04.901
...searching and pursuing...

00:01:04.908 --> 00:01:08.650
...the meaning of it all.

00:01:08.643 --> 00:01:10.710
Truth is nothing but a labyrinth...

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.436
...that we try to continue through...

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:16.127
...especially when we are hurt.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.279
I'll take you, so come this way.

00:01:18.284 --> 00:01:20.111
I'm certain that, on that day...

00:01:20.116 --> 00:01:24.050
...I'll see your smile, face to face!

00:01:33.439 --> 00:01:38.944
To find the truth behind the mysterious
disappearances of seven people in ten years...

00:01:39.445 --> 00:01:42.323
...we from Q Class have begun an undercover
investigation in Kamikakushi village.

00:01:43.157 --> 00:01:44.867
But, soon after our arrival...

00:01:45.075 --> 00:01:47.536
...two people from a TV crew staying
at the same inn as we...

00:01:47.661 --> 00:01:49.663
...were killed under the disguise
of mysterious disappearances.

00:01:50.664 --> 00:01:51.957
Who is the perpetrator?

00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:55.085
We suspect the high priest who predicted
the mysterious disappearances...

00:01:55.461 --> 00:01:58.797
...so we decided to watch the only
path connecting the two villages.

00:01:59.506 --> 00:02:03.719
But, a third murder occurred as if
the perpetrator was mocking us.

00:02:07.306 --> 00:02:11.018
What? Iwashimizu-san was killed,
just like the high priest foretold?

00:02:11.268 --> 00:02:11.685
Yeah.

00:02:12.186 --> 00:02:14.480
Either way I look at it, that
high priest is suspicious.

00:02:15.189 --> 00:02:17.316
Did anything happen at the tunnel?

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:22.571
No, since Mio-san came this evening,
no one's gone through the tunnel.

00:02:23.072 --> 00:02:26.200
Which means the high priest's alibi is perfect.

00:02:27.076 --> 00:02:28.744
I guess that's what it means.

00:02:30.454 --> 00:02:32.206
Alright, I'll call again later.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.625
Megu, you be careful now.

00:02:35.042 --> 00:02:35.501
Yeah.

00:02:35.751 --> 00:02:36.377
You guys too.

00:02:37.002 --> 00:02:37.378
Later.

00:02:39.463 --> 00:02:40.339
Thanks, Mio-san.

00:02:40.631 --> 00:02:40.965
No problem.

00:02:42.049 --> 00:02:44.051
Oh, are you going back to the guard house?

00:02:44.551 --> 00:02:45.719
I have to go get Ryu-kun.

00:02:46.387 --> 00:02:49.723
A third murder happened just
like the high priest predicted.

00:02:50.432 --> 00:02:51.934
Then I'll go along too.

00:02:52.309 --> 00:02:54.395
It's pretty late and it would be
dangerous if you went alone.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.241
The high priest has a perfect alibi.

00:03:07.491 --> 00:03:09.493
What the hell's going on?

00:03:09.827 --> 00:03:11.203
That's easy.

00:03:11.704 --> 00:03:14.498
That means that the perpetrator is
someone living in Hyoutan village.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:15.207
No.

00:03:15.624 --> 00:03:18.002
My intuition says the high
priest is definitely guilty.

00:03:18.293 --> 00:03:19.294
It's some trick!

00:03:20.546 --> 00:03:22.339
He went through the tunnel
disguised as someone else.

00:03:23.298 --> 00:03:25.634
Or maybe there's another tunnel.

00:03:26.051 --> 00:03:29.388
You and Kyuu checked around the
village a few times, didn't you?

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.642
With a tunnel 15 kilometers long that
takes 30 minutes to transverse...

00:03:33.684 --> 00:03:36.228
...it's impossible for you to have
missed a second similar one.

00:03:36.687 --> 00:03:37.479
Damn it.

00:03:38.313 --> 00:03:39.023
What are you doing?

00:03:39.189 --> 00:03:41.025
When I'm stuck, I do sit-ups!

00:03:41.608 --> 00:03:42.943
Stop it already!

00:03:45.529 --> 00:03:46.280
Yes, come in.

00:03:47.531 --> 00:03:50.951
Excuse me, Detective Ootawara from the
prefecture police is here to see you.

00:03:51.493 --> 00:03:53.537
This is important, everyone,
something big happened!

00:03:59.293 --> 00:04:01.920
This is getting bad real quick.

00:04:02.254 --> 00:04:04.339
First, the Hyoutan village graveyard.

00:04:04.798 --> 00:04:06.091
As you predicted...

00:04:06.467 --> 00:04:12.056
...the bodies of those declared "spirited
away" have been found.

00:04:12.973 --> 00:04:13.599
I see.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.477
What about the murder of Iwashimizu-san?

00:04:17.728 --> 00:04:18.812
We believe the perpetrator used the backdoor...

00:04:19.146 --> 00:04:21.940
...to enter the building because it was unlocked.

00:04:22.274 --> 00:04:23.150
Cause of death was...

00:04:23.275 --> 00:04:23.942
Detective Ootawara.

00:04:24.026 --> 00:04:24.401
Yes?

00:04:25.194 --> 00:04:28.447
Have you checked the tea cup or
the pot in the victim's room?

00:04:28.697 --> 00:04:29.323
Pot?

00:04:29.615 --> 00:04:30.949
Why should we check something like that?

00:04:31.283 --> 00:04:32.701
Please pass those items to forensics.

00:04:33.285 --> 00:04:35.996
You should find traces of sedatives.

00:04:36.288 --> 00:04:37.414
Sedatives?

00:04:37.831 --> 00:04:39.374
How can you be sure?

00:04:39.958 --> 00:04:42.336
Because, when Kinta hit the switch by the door...

00:04:42.795 --> 00:04:45.714
...the lights immediately came on.

00:04:47.174 --> 00:04:47.925
What does that mean?

00:04:48.383 --> 00:04:52.262
Next to Iwashimizu-san was an open magazine.

00:04:53.347 --> 00:04:57.976
Which means that he was reading in bed.

00:04:58.727 --> 00:05:00.062
And when you get tired...

00:05:00.687 --> 00:05:04.316
...you usually turn off the light
with the string switch, right?

00:05:05.275 --> 00:05:06.401
But, if you do that...

00:05:07.069 --> 00:05:08.904
...the switch by the door won't turn on the lights.

00:05:09.404 --> 00:05:09.905
Ah.

00:05:10.864 --> 00:05:11.448
And...

00:05:12.074 --> 00:05:15.744
...the blanket was weirdly placed
over the open magazine.

00:05:16.411 --> 00:05:18.455
Then Iwashimizu-san was stabbed
through the blanket.

00:05:19.248 --> 00:05:20.666
Judging from this, we can infer...

00:05:21.333 --> 00:05:23.710
...that Iwashimizu-san fell
asleep with the light on...

00:05:24.294 --> 00:05:26.171
...and the perpetrator came in with the knife.

00:05:27.089 --> 00:05:31.093
Then he covered Iwashimizu-san with the
blanket to prevent blood splatter...

00:05:32.344 --> 00:05:32.886
...and stabbed him.

00:05:34.555 --> 00:05:35.722
I got it!

00:05:36.223 --> 00:05:37.766
The fact that the perpetrator...

00:05:38.058 --> 00:05:40.561
...could enter a lighted room without
any hesitation means that...

00:05:40.561 --> 00:05:40.936
Yeah.

00:05:41.812 --> 00:05:46.066
This is possible because the perpetrator knew
that Iwashimlzu-san wouldn't easily wake up.

00:05:47.109 --> 00:05:47.943
Which means...

00:05:48.569 --> 00:05:50.988
...the perpetrator had given
Iwashimlzu-san a sedative.

00:05:51.613 --> 00:05:52.531
U-Understood.

00:05:52.906 --> 00:05:55.951
I'll have the tea cup and the pot
sent to forensics right away.

00:05:56.827 --> 00:05:58.745
Now then, I have statements to collect.

00:06:01.999 --> 00:06:02.332
Huh?

00:06:02.749 --> 00:06:03.834
Wait a minute, Kyuu.

00:06:04.376 --> 00:06:07.129
If the perpetrator turned off the lights
With the switch by the door...

00:06:07.796 --> 00:06:09.214
...then what was that sound
of the breaking glass?

00:06:09.715 --> 00:06:10.966
Probably a false hint.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:12.759
This means that the perpetrator...

00:06:13.343 --> 00:06:13.844
Yeah.

00:06:14.261 --> 00:06:17.347
The perpetrator could be
someone within this inn.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.685
Let's go take a look at how the
statements are proceeding.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.731
Kyuu, you really are quite something.

00:06:26.523 --> 00:06:27.149
Yeah.

00:06:27.316 --> 00:06:31.403
The backdoor is never locked so you
can go to the outside bath any time.

00:06:32.029 --> 00:06:34.990
Then at the time of the murder,
around 11:00pm...

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.366
...what were you doing?

00:06:36.867 --> 00:06:37.993
I was watching TV.

00:06:38.327 --> 00:06:43.165
It was a weird drama where the grandson
of Kindaichi Kosuke solves difficult cases.

00:06:43.582 --> 00:06:45.167
Do you guys know any show like that?

00:06:45.626 --> 00:06:46.668
I've never heard of it.

00:06:46.835 --> 00:06:48.128
I swear it by my grandfathers's name.

00:06:49.421 --> 00:06:54.968
Yes, I was in the kitchen preparing
tomorrow's meals.

00:06:56.345 --> 00:06:57.679
I was in my room.

00:06:58.347 --> 00:07:01.433
I heard the glass shatter and
hurried out into the hallway.

00:07:01.683 --> 00:07:04.102
The guests were hastily running about.

00:07:05.354 --> 00:07:08.523
I was in my room checking the schedule.

00:07:09.107 --> 00:07:12.986
Iwashimizu-san said we'd be leaving
this village tomorrow.

00:07:15.197 --> 00:07:16.490
I wasn't...

00:07:17.032 --> 00:07:17.783
...doing anything.

00:07:18.158 --> 00:07:20.744
You're a former Ekishin follower?

00:07:21.578 --> 00:07:25.958
That's true, I was a believer until
three and a half years ago.

00:07:26.208 --> 00:07:28.627
And I lived in the neighboring
Kamikakushi village.

00:07:29.044 --> 00:07:31.171
But, I currently have no connection
with them at all.

00:07:31.505 --> 00:07:33.674
I see, thank you.

00:07:33.715 --> 00:07:34.633
Excuse me.

00:07:35.133 --> 00:07:37.719
There's no way anything will be revealed
with that kind of formal questioning.

00:07:39.221 --> 00:07:39.888
What's wrong, Kyuu?

00:07:40.931 --> 00:07:43.517
That last statement made me remember
something that bothered me.

00:07:44.434 --> 00:07:45.227
Detective Ootawara.

00:07:45.352 --> 00:07:45.811
What is it?

00:07:46.853 --> 00:07:48.105
There's been a call from headquarters.

00:07:48.814 --> 00:07:50.482
Among the bodies found in the graveyard...

00:07:51.024 --> 00:07:56.029
...was a body that matches the missing college
student from Kamikakushi village.

00:07:56.613 --> 00:07:57.155
I see.

00:07:58.991 --> 00:07:59.950
What did you say?
What did you say?

00:08:02.411 --> 00:08:04.121
That's impossible...

00:08:04.496 --> 00:08:06.873
there's no way the body of the missing college
student from Kamikakushi village...

00:08:07.332 --> 00:08:09.126
...could be in a graveyard in this village.

00:08:09.251 --> 00:08:10.544
In that case, the perpetrator
would have had to...

00:08:11.044 --> 00:08:13.797
...carry the body for the thirty minute trip...

00:08:14.131 --> 00:08:17.509
...through the tunnel from Kamikakushi
village to Hyoutan village?

00:08:18.135 --> 00:08:22.639
And he was able to pass through the
checkpoint that is guarded 24/7?

00:08:24.975 --> 00:08:29.521
Climbing those cliffs carrying a
body is even more impossible.

00:08:31.648 --> 00:08:33.775
That high priest has a perfect alibi.

00:08:34.318 --> 00:08:34.860
However...

00:08:40.324 --> 00:08:40.991
What is it?

00:08:41.325 --> 00:08:42.117
I don't know yet...

00:08:42.701 --> 00:08:45.620
....but maybe the college student
and the reporter, Azegami-san...

00:08:46.204 --> 00:08:48.248
...were killed because of this drawing.

00:08:48.623 --> 00:08:49.082
Huh?

00:08:49.708 --> 00:08:51.293
This drawing is the hint to solving the mystery...

00:08:51.668 --> 00:08:54.338
...behind the high priest's alibi and this village.

00:08:58.508 --> 00:08:59.885
Even though it happened...

00:09:00.469 --> 00:09:02.387
...just like the high priest said...

00:09:02.721 --> 00:09:05.015
...he has a perfect alibi...

00:09:05.557 --> 00:09:09.603
...and to top it off, we are his witnesses.

00:09:11.396 --> 00:09:12.439
Well, this time...

00:09:13.273 --> 00:09:15.525
...even I'm at a complete loss.

00:09:16.401 --> 00:09:18.695
So this happens to you too, Ryu-kun.

00:09:19.071 --> 00:09:19.529
What?

00:09:19.821 --> 00:09:22.908
Well you're a genius through and through.

00:09:23.742 --> 00:09:26.578
I thought that there wasn't a
mystery you couldn't solve.

00:09:27.829 --> 00:09:32.000
I think Kyuu‘s the more appropriate
candidate for genius than I am.

00:09:32.501 --> 00:09:33.001
What?

00:09:33.585 --> 00:09:35.962
Well, yeah Kyuu can be quite sharp sometimes.

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:38.131
But when he’s off, he's way off.

00:09:41.134 --> 00:09:42.094
That may well be...

00:09:42.677 --> 00:09:44.513
Kyuu's greatest strength.

00:09:50.894 --> 00:09:51.937
There has to be something...

00:09:52.354 --> 00:09:55.357
...hidden in this drawing that
points to this village's secret.

00:09:56.233 --> 00:09:58.110
And either way I look at it...

00:09:58.819 --> 00:09:59.861
...that person's statement was strange.

00:10:00.946 --> 00:10:02.823
It was said without any hesitation.

00:10:04.366 --> 00:10:04.991
Hey.

00:10:05.534 --> 00:10:06.076
Kyuu.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:08.203
I was wondering where you disappeared to.

00:10:08.954 --> 00:10:10.664
What are you doing up here?

00:10:12.958 --> 00:10:14.835
I just thought I could use
a change of perspective.

00:10:15.877 --> 00:10:18.380
I learned this from the detective...

00:10:18.588 --> 00:10:19.840
...that saved me way back.

00:10:21.091 --> 00:10:23.760
If you're stuck on something, you
should change your perspective.

00:10:24.261 --> 00:10:25.303
Detective?

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:26.179
Yeah.

00:10:27.389 --> 00:10:29.891
He's my favorite person; I respect
him more than anyone else.

00:10:31.226 --> 00:10:34.020
He said that, "If you look at things from
the side, under or from above...

00:10:34.604 --> 00:10:37.858
...you'll begin seeing things that
you didn't notice earlier."

00:10:38.024 --> 00:10:38.400
And?

00:10:39.025 --> 00:10:40.485
Did you figure something out
after climbing up here?

00:10:41.903 --> 00:10:42.529
Not yet.

00:10:43.363 --> 00:10:45.073
Well at this time of day...

00:10:45.449 --> 00:10:47.617
...it's too gloomy to see anything.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.123
Looks like it's dawn.

00:10:53.999 --> 00:10:56.251
I guess we can see the sunrise for once.

00:11:13.185 --> 00:11:13.852
I see!

00:11:14.352 --> 00:11:15.395
Maybe that's what this means.

00:11:15.562 --> 00:11:16.271
What is it, Kyuu?

00:11:16.646 --> 00:11:18.940
We gotta make a phone call, quick!
I gotta ask Ryu and Megu!

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.736
Are you stupid?

00:11:26.448 --> 00:11:26.907
What?

00:11:27.407 --> 00:11:28.700
You figured out what the drawing means?

00:11:29.993 --> 00:11:30.327
Yeah.

00:11:30.869 --> 00:11:33.705
Which means I can explain the perpetrator's
alibi trick as well.

00:11:34.289 --> 00:11:34.623
Megu.

00:11:34.873 --> 00:11:38.001
You remember the things that the missing
college student had with him, right?

00:11:38.418 --> 00:11:38.835
Yeah.

00:11:39.294 --> 00:11:39.920
Let's see...

00:11:40.295 --> 00:11:41.838
A water bottle and a Swiss army knife.

00:11:42.589 --> 00:11:43.507
A rope and a camera.

00:11:44.382 --> 00:11:45.842
A shovel and a life vest.

00:11:46.343 --> 00:11:47.010
A sleeping bag

00:11:47.552 --> 00:11:49.346
A mini air pump, a rubber raft.

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.014
A cellphone.

00:11:51.473 --> 00:11:52.140
And a compass.

00:11:52.682 --> 00:11:53.099
That's it!

00:11:53.517 --> 00:11:55.268
The college student was killed because...

00:11:55.602 --> 00:11:57.938
...he figured out the village's
secret using that compass!

00:11:58.688 --> 00:11:59.773
Because of the compass?

00:12:00.482 --> 00:12:00.899
Yeah.

00:12:01.149 --> 00:12:02.859
Your phone is cordless, right?

00:12:03.235 --> 00:12:03.735
Yes.

00:12:04.236 --> 00:12:06.613
Can you come straight to the
entrance of the tunnel?

00:12:06.905 --> 00:12:07.405
Understood.

00:12:18.416 --> 00:12:20.544
Kyuu, we're in front of the tunnel now.

00:12:20.544 --> 00:12:20.919
.

00:12:20.919 --> 00:12:22.045
What should we do now?

00:12:22.963 --> 00:12:26.508
We're in front of the tunnel
in Hyoutan village as well.

00:12:27.926 --> 00:12:28.385
Okay, Megu.

00:12:29.177 --> 00:12:30.220
Face the tunnel.

00:12:30.637 --> 00:12:31.096
Okay.

00:12:32.639 --> 00:12:33.181
Done.

00:12:33.974 --> 00:12:35.141
What do you see to your left?

00:12:38.144 --> 00:12:39.104
Nothing special.

00:12:39.646 --> 00:12:41.147
Just the cliffs and the woods.

00:12:41.606 --> 00:12:42.148
And to your right?

00:12:45.151 --> 00:12:47.696
I can see the Ryouzanpaku branch house...

00:12:48.363 --> 00:12:50.574
...that we're staying at, behind
that is the tall temple wall...

00:12:50.782 --> 00:12:52.617
...where the Ekishin high priest lives.

00:12:52.993 --> 00:12:53.410
I see.

00:12:53.827 --> 00:12:55.078
One more thing.

00:12:55.704 --> 00:12:56.997
Where's the sun?

00:12:57.581 --> 00:12:58.081
The sun?

00:12:58.623 --> 00:12:59.457
Umm...

00:13:00.625 --> 00:13:01.543
To my right.

00:13:06.506 --> 00:13:06.881
Megu.

00:13:07.132 --> 00:13:07.757
Hand me the phone.

00:13:08.425 --> 00:13:09.676
Kyuu, what about on your side?

00:13:09.884 --> 00:13:11.428
Where's the sun in relation to the tunnel?

00:13:13.096 --> 00:13:13.763
It's the same.

00:13:16.308 --> 00:13:17.017
It's to the right.

00:13:19.894 --> 00:13:21.313
So that's what it is.

00:13:22.188 --> 00:13:22.939
No...

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.274
No way.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.610
Hey, Kyuu, explain.

00:13:26.985 --> 00:13:28.403
Just what is going on.

00:13:29.195 --> 00:13:29.946
I figured it out...

00:13:30.655 --> 00:13:31.531
...this village's secret.

00:13:32.449 --> 00:13:33.116
Really?

00:13:34.659 --> 00:13:36.453
And why the mysterious disappearances
continue to happen...

00:13:37.245 --> 00:13:40.874
And why the college student and the
TV show crew had to be killed...

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.125
And...

00:13:42.917 --> 00:13:45.170
...the clever alibi trick the perpetrator used...

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.255
...when spiriting those people away.

00:13:47.631 --> 00:13:48.673
Alibi trick?

00:13:48.965 --> 00:13:50.634
Yeah, there are four hints.

00:13:51.551 --> 00:13:52.969
The first is the position of the sun.

00:13:53.511 --> 00:13:56.264
The second is the meaning of the
drawing the college student left.

00:13:57.265 --> 00:13:57.891
The third...

00:13:58.224 --> 00:14:00.644
...is the fact that the body of the college student,
who vanished in Kamikakushi village...

00:14:00.894 --> 00:14:02.646
...was found in Hyoutan village's graveyard.

00:14:03.688 --> 00:14:04.397
The fourth...

00:14:04.773 --> 00:14:06.524
...is the discrepancy in something
someone said...

00:14:06.983 --> 00:14:08.902
...which became apparent during
the police interrogation.

00:14:09.986 --> 00:14:10.445
And...

00:14:11.071 --> 00:14:13.156
...if we reveal the truth...

00:14:13.782 --> 00:14:15.867
...behind the unbelievable and old
secret of these two villages...

00:14:16.368 --> 00:14:18.119
...all the mysteries will be solved.

00:14:18.495 --> 00:14:20.580
There is only one answer!

00:14:30.334 --> 00:14:31.460
Even Detective Ootawara is here.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:36.757
Now will you please tell us...

00:14:36.798 --> 00:14:38.133
Now will you please tell us...

00:14:38.967 --> 00:14:42.846
...what you're planning to do after gathering
all of us in Kamikakushi village...

00:14:43.472 --> 00:14:43.847
...Kyuu-san?

00:14:46.183 --> 00:14:49.519
There's something I must tell everyone first.

00:14:50.229 --> 00:14:53.190
We said that we were from a detective club...

00:14:54.066 --> 00:14:59.905
...but we're actually members of DDS sent here to
investigate these "spirited away" occurrences.

00:15:01.782 --> 00:15:05.369
You mean the school of the legendary
detective, Dan Morihiko?

00:15:06.411 --> 00:15:10.457
The truth behind these "spirited away"
occurrences is rather shocking.

00:15:11.375 --> 00:15:13.835
But, please try to calmly listen until the end.

00:15:14.795 --> 00:15:15.879
Kazuma, please start.

00:15:16.255 --> 00:15:16.546
Yeah.

00:15:17.756 --> 00:15:20.008
Everyone, please take a look at this first.

00:15:22.219 --> 00:15:22.970
A notice?

00:15:23.303 --> 00:15:24.805
But it's all numbers.

00:15:25.222 --> 00:15:27.391
This is a classified, encrypted text...

00:15:27.724 --> 00:15:29.810
...created by the old Japanese
army concerning this village.

00:15:31.144 --> 00:15:34.856
After I received this from one of
my sources, I deciphered it.

00:15:35.232 --> 00:15:36.775
And we discovered something terrible.

00:15:38.235 --> 00:15:40.112
Here in Kamikakushi village
and Hyoutan village...

00:15:40.904 --> 00:15:45.993
...there were military facilities created to
develop biological weapons using smallpox.

00:15:48.453 --> 00:15:49.496
Biological weapons?

00:15:50.205 --> 00:15:50.914
Oowada-san.

00:15:51.456 --> 00:15:53.625
The old Japanese army treasure...

00:15:54.084 --> 00:15:56.044
...you people from the TV station
were searching for...

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:59.256
...was basically this biological weapon.

00:15:59.631 --> 00:16:00.799
This can't be true...

00:16:01.717 --> 00:16:04.636
This village, a place for developing
biological weapons?

00:16:04.803 --> 00:16:05.387
But...

00:16:06.096 --> 00:16:08.432
...in this village with its dangerous
military facility...

00:16:09.224 --> 00:16:10.559
...a tragedy occurred.

00:16:11.393 --> 00:16:14.813
To hide this fact, after the war,
the military created...

00:16:15.605 --> 00:16:19.359
...the Ekishin religion with its smallpox
theme and this main temple.

00:16:19.943 --> 00:16:21.278
Whoever got too close to the secret...

00:16:21.737 --> 00:16:26.158
...was erased by the high priest
via "spiriting away."

00:16:29.911 --> 00:16:30.412
And...

00:16:31.121 --> 00:16:35.250
...the face of the Ekishin high priest
that no one has seen before...

00:16:36.084 --> 00:16:38.295
...is that of someone in this room.

00:16:39.129 --> 00:16:40.213
Cut it out already!

00:16:40.881 --> 00:16:43.633
What you're saying about the creation
of the Ekishin religion...

00:16:44.051 --> 00:16:47.929
...or that the high priest is one of
us here is all utter nonsense!

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:49.514
It's not nonsense!

00:16:50.098 --> 00:16:53.268
It seems like you want to depict
the high priest as a murderer...

00:16:53.977 --> 00:16:55.645
...but how do you explain last night's case?

00:16:56.271 --> 00:16:58.648
The high priest had a perfect alibi.

00:16:58.982 --> 00:16:59.316
Yes.

00:16:59.858 --> 00:17:03.236
Ryu-san and Megu-san got permission
from the high priest...

00:17:03.904 --> 00:17:06.323
...and were in the guard house, watching
the tunnel the whole time, right?

00:17:06.948 --> 00:17:09.618
And no one that could have been
the high priest went through.

00:17:09.993 --> 00:17:10.660
That's true.

00:17:10.994 --> 00:17:12.954
If you still want to go around calling
the high priest the perpetrator...

00:17:13.455 --> 00:17:16.208
...even though he has such a bulletproof alibi...

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:19.669
...a lot of the believers in this village won't stay quiet...

00:17:20.212 --> 00:17:22.172
...even if the police are around.

00:17:26.385 --> 00:17:26.968
Like you said...

00:17:27.636 --> 00:17:32.015
...I don't think the high priest went through that
tunnel when Iwashimizu-san was killed.

00:17:33.141 --> 00:17:34.101
But it's possible...

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:37.771
given without making the
thirty minute tunnel trip...

00:17:38.313 --> 00:17:41.149
...to move between the two
villages more quickly.

00:17:41.525 --> 00:17:41.900
What?

00:17:42.317 --> 00:17:42.818
That's ridiculous!

00:17:42.984 --> 00:17:45.904
I've been living in this village for over 30 years...

00:17:46.113 --> 00:17:49.825
...and even I don't know of anyone who ever
used a different path to the village.

00:17:50.117 --> 00:17:54.037
What's more, how are you supposed to climb those
cliffs that could easily give away under you?

00:17:54.329 --> 00:17:55.789
It's certainly impossible!

00:17:57.332 --> 00:17:58.959
That's what I initially though, too.

00:17:59.543 --> 00:18:01.044
So when the incident occurred I assumed...

00:18:01.628 --> 00:18:04.297
...that someone from the neighboring
village could not be the perpetrator.

00:18:05.924 --> 00:18:07.676
...then I noticed my mistake...

00:18:08.635 --> 00:18:10.178
...thanks to something one of you said.

00:18:10.387 --> 00:18:11.179
Who's this someone?

00:18:11.555 --> 00:18:12.139
Oowada-san...

00:18:12.722 --> 00:18:13.348
It's you.

00:18:13.974 --> 00:18:14.433
No way.

00:18:14.808 --> 00:18:15.851
Oowada-san?

00:18:16.059 --> 00:18:16.977
D-Don't be silly.

00:18:17.227 --> 00:18:18.812
Why would I kill Iwashimizu-san and the others?

00:18:19.104 --> 00:18:21.398
We didn't say that Oowada-san
is the perpetrator.

00:18:22.607 --> 00:18:23.191
Right.

00:18:24.359 --> 00:18:25.026
To be honest...

00:18:25.777 --> 00:18:28.029
...we were quietly listening...

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:29.656
...when you were being interrogated
by the police.

00:18:30.365 --> 00:18:30.949
Back then...

00:18:31.408 --> 00:18:32.617
...Oowada-san said...

00:18:33.994 --> 00:18:37.998
That's true, I was a believer until
three and a half years ago.

00:18:38.331 --> 00:18:40.917
And I lived in the neighboring
Kamikakushi village.

00:18:41.293 --> 00:18:42.127
Yeah I did, but...

00:18:42.502 --> 00:18:45.714
Oowada-san, you've never lived
in Hyoutan village, correct?

00:18:45.881 --> 00:18:46.673
That's right.

00:18:47.048 --> 00:18:49.634
I trained here in this Kamikakushi
village as a believer!

00:18:50.302 --> 00:18:53.221
When I heard that, something struck me as odd.

00:18:54.055 --> 00:18:54.473
<i>You</i> see...

00:18:55.015 --> 00:18:58.560
When I asked a certain person in Kamikakushi
village about Oowada-san...

00:18:58.852 --> 00:19:03.106
They clearly said, "Oowada-san lived in the
neighboring village three years ago."

00:19:03.857 --> 00:19:05.108
Isn't that so, Mio-san?

00:19:06.193 --> 00:19:11.323
When you were supposedly in Kamikakushi village
talking on the phone to me in Hyoutan village...

00:19:12.073 --> 00:19:15.494
...why did you call Kamikakushi village where
Oowada-san lived the "neighboring village"?

00:19:15.869 --> 00:19:18.371
He used to be an Ekishin believer.

00:19:18.914 --> 00:19:21.416
His appearance changed so I didn't
realize it for a long time...

00:19:21.791 --> 00:19:24.252
...but until three years ago he used
to live in the neighboring village.

00:19:24.961 --> 00:19:26.671
W-What are you talking about?

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:29.216
The fact that you're trying to play dumb...

00:19:29.841 --> 00:19:31.218
...proves that this isn't a mistake.

00:19:31.968 --> 00:19:32.636
0
Emma Mio-san...

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:35.096
...you're the high priest of the Ekishin religion...

00:19:35.764 --> 00:19:39.434
...and you're the true perpetrator behind these
murders disguised as "spiriting away"!

00:19:40.185 --> 00:19:41.102
No way!

00:19:41.269 --> 00:19:41.853
She is?

00:19:42.312 --> 00:19:42.938
I can't believe it!

00:19:43.396 --> 00:19:45.482
Mio-san is the high priest?

00:19:46.024 --> 00:19:48.568
When I was talking to you about Oowada-san...

00:19:49.361 --> 00:19:51.863
...you were in Hyoutan village
to kill Iwashimlzu-san.

00:19:52.572 --> 00:19:55.033
That's why you accidentally spoke
of Kamikakushi village...

00:19:55.116 --> 00:19:56.868
...as being the neighboring village
without thinking about it.

00:19:57.285 --> 00:19:57.994
Isn't it true?

00:20:01.873 --> 00:20:02.916
I'm sorry, Kyuu-san.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:05.335
Did I say the neighboring village?

00:20:05.752 --> 00:20:08.171
If I did say it, it was just a mistake.

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:11.049
Besides, you must have heard the wall clock...

00:20:11.174 --> 00:20:14.469
...that's in Kamikakushi village when
we started talking on the phone!

00:20:15.262 --> 00:20:22.352
There's no doubt that I called you in Hyoutan
village from Kamikakushi village.

00:20:23.019 --> 00:20:24.354
Besides the sound of the wall clock...

00:20:24.813 --> 00:20:28.942
...Ryu-san can testify that I didn't
go back through the tunnel.

00:20:30.819 --> 00:20:33.947
And if I was in Kamikakushi speaking
to you on the phone...

00:20:34.114 --> 00:20:36.241
...when Iwashimizu-san was killed...

00:20:36.908 --> 00:20:37.617
Kyuu-san...

00:20:37.909 --> 00:20:39.995
...you're an alibi witness too, aren't you?

00:20:40.537 --> 00:20:42.664
After the glass broke...

00:20:43.081 --> 00:20:44.541
...and you guys ran into Iwashimizu-san's room...

00:20:44.749 --> 00:20:47.168
...you found him lying under his blanket
right alter he was killed...

00:20:47.294 --> 00:20:47.669
Wait.

00:20:48.378 --> 00:20:49.337
Under his blanket.

00:20:50.088 --> 00:20:51.339
How do you know that?

00:20:52.382 --> 00:20:53.592
The only people that know that are...

00:20:54.259 --> 00:20:58.763
...the police and the people that saw
Iwashimizu-san's body in Hyoutan village.

00:21:01.558 --> 00:21:03.602
Why, Mio-san, why?

00:21:04.894 --> 00:21:06.479
How could these horrible murders...

00:21:07.355 --> 00:21:10.108
...have been committed by someone
as pure and genuine as you?

00:21:10.984 --> 00:21:14.446
To hide the secrets and lies of this village...

00:21:14.779 --> 00:21:15.739
...you killed in cold blood...

00:21:15.864 --> 00:21:17.365
Cut it out already!

00:21:18.742 --> 00:21:20.035
What do you mean by lies?

00:21:20.327 --> 00:21:22.078
What are the lies of this village?

00:21:22.954 --> 00:21:25.081
All the people that come from outside
the village are always like this!

00:21:25.332 --> 00:21:27.167
They don't have manners and they're greedy...

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:29.294
...calling it a treasure hunt
and ravaging the village...

00:21:29.711 --> 00:21:32.130
...and to top it off they even
make fun of Ekigami-sama!

00:21:32.297 --> 00:21:35.258
You're all trying to wreck this village!

00:21:37.218 --> 00:21:38.011
Leave...

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:41.222
Alright.

00:21:42.182 --> 00:21:44.059
If you're going to go that far,
then please come with us.

00:21:45.602 --> 00:21:50.857
We will show you the grand lie that
has hidden the sins of this village!

00:21:52.150 --> 00:21:52.817
Kurozumi-san.

00:21:53.652 --> 00:21:54.611
Are there any people in these two villages...

00:21:54.903 --> 00:21:56.613
...that have lived here since the war?

00:21:57.405 --> 00:22:00.992
The last one was Mio's grandfather who was
responsible for the dam in Hyoutan village.

00:22:01.368 --> 00:22:03.953
Put he passed away last year.

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:06.790
I guess those people...

00:22:07.457 --> 00:22:09.918
....were the ones that setup this village's big lie.

00:22:10.585 --> 00:22:12.671
The fact that the body of the college student
that disappeared in this village...

00:22:13.004 --> 00:22:14.881
...was found in the graveyard
in Hyoutan village...

00:22:15.173 --> 00:22:17.801
...can be explained once we expose this big lie.

00:22:18.385 --> 00:22:21.638
What on earth is this village's big
lie you keep talking about?

00:22:22.013 --> 00:22:24.683
The answer to that is behind this wall.

00:22:24.808 --> 00:22:25.392
Hey!

00:22:26.184 --> 00:22:27.811
I'm ready!

00:22:29.062 --> 00:22:30.855
What are you going to do with that pickaxe?

00:22:31.856 --> 00:22:32.857
Isn't it obvious?

00:22:34.401 --> 00:22:37.946
I'm going to break down this wall that
has been built with so many lies!

00:22:41.616 --> 00:22:42.325
What blasphemy!

00:22:42.701 --> 00:22:43.618
Not done yet?

00:22:44.661 --> 00:22:45.870
Another one!

00:22:46.162 --> 00:22:47.288
Stop!

00:22:48.790 --> 00:22:49.958
If the wall breaks...

00:22:51.626 --> 00:22:52.502
...this world is going to...

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:55.380
...is going to be destroyed!

00:23:06.099 --> 00:23:07.434
What have you done?

00:23:08.017 --> 00:23:11.354
The sacred wall that nobody but
the high priest may pass...

00:23:11.938 --> 00:23:15.984
Please see for yourself what's behind this wall.

00:23:16.609 --> 00:23:17.569
Behind the wall?

00:23:29.164 --> 00:23:30.373
No way!

00:23:37.342 --> 00:23:40.549
The Sun is setting in a red glow...

00:23:41.141 --> 00:23:43.680
...as it follows me.

00:23:44.018 --> 00:23:46.849
Along this deserted beach...

00:23:46.852 --> 00:23:50.783
...I walk alone once more.

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:54.165
I can't continue to hold in...

00:23:54.817 --> 00:23:57.149
...the tears that should pour out.

00:23:57.786 --> 00:24:00.253
Why have these memories...

00:24:00.263 --> 00:24:03.793
...become so wonderful?

00:24:04.337 --> 00:24:09.356
Ah... Like an ocean wave, I return to you...

00:24:09.606 --> 00:24:12.129
...because I'm so in love.

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:15.846
And, now my heart...

00:24:15.851 --> 00:24:17.990
...is heavy with pain.

00:24:18.944 --> 00:24:21.884
Reflections of a bright rainbow...

00:24:21.987 --> 00:24:26.147
...shine on the distant shores of yesterday.

00:24:26.487 --> 00:24:30.118
I'll never forget those days...

00:24:30.125 --> 00:24:35.211
...and I long to see you again.

00:24:37.216 --> 00:24:40.594
The cruel serial murders that were committed
to remedy the tragedies of the past.

00:24:41.303 --> 00:24:43.180
Q Class has solved all the mysteries.

00:24:43.931 --> 00:24:48.018
The surprising secret and the truth behind
the "spiriting away” that utilized it.

00:24:48.811 --> 00:24:50.896
The truth is revealed along with a shock.

00:24:51.438 --> 00:24:53.565
And the final tragedy has begun.

00:24:54.316 --> 00:24:55.359
There is only one answer!

00:24:56.860 --> 00:24:59.530
Have you figured out where I was this week?

00:24:59.905 --> 00:25:00.572
The answer is...

00:25:01.365 --> 00:25:01.949
That?

00:25:02.241 --> 00:25:04.034
No, no, that's just a plain cactus.

00:25:04.326 --> 00:25:05.285
The real answer is...

00:25:08.414 --> 00:25:09.915
Did you figure it out?

00:25:10.416 --> 00:25:11.291
Like that's possible!
Like that's possible!
